            "repere": "Paragraphe · Kinobody isn't about grinding yourself…",
            "text": "Kinobody isn't about grinding yourself into the ground five or six days a week. It's about building a lean, powerful, movie-star physique with two to three focused workouts a week and a system so enjoyable you'll follow it for the rest of your life. Because when the gym only takes two to three hours of your week, you have the time and energy to excel everywhere else that matters. That's why our programs and supplements have transformed hundreds of thousands of actors, entrepreneurs, and everyday men worldwide into the best versions of themselves.",
